      "text": "So based on your history I don't have a clear answer today: a possible stroke, within the treatment window is possible and so is a migraine with aura. I'm going to order an urgent CT scan of the head for possible stroke. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'd like to arrange a blood sugar test for stroke symptoms. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
