      "text": "Call an ambulance now, you need hospital immediately. I'd like you to see the stroke team as well, and I'll write the referral. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Please don't wait if the symptoms change. That's when to be seen urgently. Let's review you straight away."
